  }
  decisions_single: resource_reallocation (<5 s; within S5 bounds; e.g. S1_a 90% RAM vs
    S1_b 20% → rebalance) | threshold_enforcement (<1 s; e.g. thermal_c 65°C → throttle 20%)
    | S4_decision_application (<10 s; translate S4 high-level → concrete params; in-budget
      single-loop else escalate) | S2_policy_authorship (<5 min; e.g. longer cooldown on oscillation)
  decisions_double: bound_violation_request (S4/S3 analysis requires exceeding S5 hard bounds;
